  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.\r\rReason: This is required by Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).",
    "The development to which this permission relates shall be carried out in accordance with the materials specified on the approved plans and on the submitted application form unless otherwise agreed in writing by the local planning authority.\r\rReason: To ensure a satisfactory appearance on completion of the development, in accordance with Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8 and DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012.",
    "The works shall be carried out and maintained in accordance with the deposited Fire Safety Strategy compliant with Policy D12(A).\r\rReason: In the interests of fire safety and to ensure the safety of all building users in accordance with Policy D12 (Fire Safety) of the London Plan 2021.",
    "Prior to beneficial occupation of the development to which this permission relates, the drainage system as shown in Flood Risk Assessment (Date: 22 July 2025) shall be implemented in full and permanently maintained thereafter.\r\rReason: To prevent the development from increasing the risk of flooding to the site itself or elsewhere, in accordance withpolicies CS1 and DM4 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012."
